A||||6||Patrick's Dad||So long, and thanks for all the fish....||||9||
Z||000000||Patrick's Dad||05-13-2001||03:28 PM||||If any of you are Hitchhiker's Guide fans, and haven't heard, Douglas Adams passed away this weekend. He was (I was told) working out, when he had a heart attack. He was 49. My two album set of The HitchHiker's Guide to the Galaxy is autographed, "To the hoopiest frood this side of Milliway's,"<P>THHGttG is easily one of my favorite series (at his fourth installment, he was still calling it a trilogy), science fiction or otherwise. In fact there was little, if any science in it, but what a heck of a story. Pick 'em up if you haven't. It's always nice to know that you know where your towel is.<P>DA, thanks for the laughs. Hopefully, we'll see you at The Restaraunt at the End of the Universe....||||reg||9
